{
  "id": "MAT.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matt. 9",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus Forgives and Heals a Paralyzed Man",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus stepped into a boat, crossed over and came to his own town.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Some men brought to him a paralyzed man, lying on a mat. When Jesus saw their faith, he said to the man,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Take heart, son; your sins are forgiven.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At this, some of the teachers of the law said to themselves, \"This fellow is blaspheming!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Knowing their thoughts, Jesus said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Why do you entertain evil thoughts in your hearts?",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Which is easier: to say, 'Your sins are forgiven,' or to say, 'Get up and walk'?",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "But I want you to know that the Son of Man has authority on earth to forgive sins.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So he said to the paralyzed man,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Get up, take your mat and go home.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the man got up and went home.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the crowd saw this, they were filled with awe; and they praised God, who had given such authority to man.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Calling of Matthew",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As Jesus went on from there, he saw a man named Matthew sitting at the tax collector's booth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Follow me,\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he told him, and Matthew got up and followed him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While Jesus was having dinner at Matthew's house, many tax collectors and sinners came and ate with him and his disciples.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the Pharisees saw this, they asked his disciples, \"Why does your teacher eat with tax collectors and sinners?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On hearing this, Jesus said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"It is not the healthy who need a doctor, but the sick.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "But go and learn what this means: 'I desire mercy, not sacrifice.'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "For I have not come to call the righteous, but sinners.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus Questioned About Fasting",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then John's disciples came and asked him, \"How is it that we and the Pharisees fast often, but your disciples do not fast?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"How can the guests of the bridegroom mourn while he is with them? The time will come when the bridegroom will be taken from them; then they will fast.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"No one sews a patch of unshrunk cloth on an old garment, for the patch will pull away from the garment, making the tear worse.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Neither do people pour new wine into old wineskins. If they do, the skins will burst; the wine will run out and the wineskins will be ruined. No, they pour new wine into new wineskins, and both are preserved.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus Raises a Dead Girl and Heals a Sick Woman",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While he was saying this, a synagogue leader came and knelt before him and said, \"My daughter has just died. But come and put your hand on her, and she will live.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus got up and went with him, and so did his disciples.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Just then a woman who had been subject to bleeding for twelve years came up behind him and touched the edge of his cloak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She said to herself, \"If I only touch his cloak, I will be healed.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus turned and saw her.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Take heart, daughter,\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"your faith has healed you.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the woman was healed at that moment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jesus entered the synagogue leader's house and saw the noisy crowd and people playing pipes,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Go away. The girl is not dead but asleep.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they laughed at him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After the crowd had been put outside, he went in and took the girl by the hand, and she got up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "News of this spread through all that region.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus Heals the Blind and the Mute",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As Jesus went on from there, two blind men followed him, calling out, \"Have mercy on us, Son of David!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When he had gone indoors, the blind men came to him, and he asked them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Do you believe that I am able to do this?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAT 9:28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Yes, Lord,\" they replied.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he touched their eyes and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"According to your faith let it be done to you\";",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and their sight was restored. Jesus warned them sternly,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"See that no one knows about this.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they went out and spread the news about him all over that region.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While they were going out, a man who was demon-possessed and could not talk was brought to Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the demon was driven out, the man who had been mute spoke. The crowd was amazed and said, \"Nothing like this has ever been seen in Israel.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the Pharisees said, \"It is by the prince of demons that he drives out demons.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Workers Are Few",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus went through all the towns and villages, teaching in their synagogues, proclaiming the good news of the kingdom and healing every disease and sickness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When he saw the crowds, he had compassion on them, because they were harassed and helpless, like sheep without a shepherd.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he said to his disciples,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"The harvest is plentiful but the workers are few.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.37",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.37"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Ask the Lord of the harvest, therefore, to send out workers into his harvest field.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.9.38",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.9.38"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
